00:00:57.266 --> 00:01:02.433 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des AVC. Il y a eu un AVC?

00:00:59.766 --> 00:01:03.800 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Oui j'ai eu mmeme

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:05.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
