00:02:11.233 --> 00:02:15.300 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ou la Cour supérieure.

00:02:12.633 --> 00:02:16.700 size:53% position:73% line:53%
En attendant, les résidents,

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:17.133 size:53% position:73% line:53%
